==Strategy==
In a similar vein to how [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] works very well on the original Floor 35, talented [[Actress Cat (Special Cat)|Beefcake Cat]] works well here due to his Surge Immunity letting him survive Condemned Pengs and increased bulk to combat the higher threat of Manic Island. Even spamming both can work with high enough levels!

Spamming ranged units alone without meatshielding or melee units can work on this stage, as it becomes highly likely that Dolphinas will be unable to attack at all, reducing the overall chip Dolphina and Condemned Pengs do over time.

It's worth noting that the Manic Island spawns are limited here, as opposed to the infinite Crazed Fishes that spawn on the original Floor 35. Holding out long enough will guarantee a win.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Ancient Egg: N001 (Special Cat)|Haniwa Cat]]: can be spammed and creates a strong enough wall to delay enemy pushes even when Condemmed Peng dies.
*[[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]]: fits nicely in Dolphina's blindspot and deals [[Massive Damage]] to most of the enemies.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*Any [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] unit works very well here thanks to a combination of resistances, and abilities tailored to Traitless enemies. Notably, [[Dark Mitama (Uber Rare Cat)|Gothic Mitama]] and [[King of Doom Phono (Uber Rare Cat)|King of Extinction Phono]] are especially useful for this stage.
*[[Issun Boshi (Uber Rare Cat)|Oni Battlepod Kozuchimaru]]: nukes the Manic Islands, Dolphinas and is [[Immune to Surge]].

